TUDOR TIMES WEEKLY =E2=80=94 week of 01 November 1539
Your trusted source for crown, court and countryside.

THIS WEEK IN HISTORY:
  * Henry VIII reigned from 1509 to 1547 =E2=80=94 nearly thirty-eight years.
  * Catherine Parr was the first woman to publish a book in English under her=
 own name in England.
  * Anne Boleyn's daughter, Elizabeth, would reign for forty-four years.

COURT WHISPERS: Wagers are being laid on the date of the next royal progress.

WEATHER: Grey, with a chance of beheadings. (Editorial humour; no offence int=
ended.)

